# Blinding quarantine. Retrieved bodies containing populated prohibited market
# data (price, percentage change, volume and the like), or whose bytes could not
# be decoded and therefore could not be verified free of it, are held OUTSIDE
# version control and are never re-inspected. Only their SHA-256, retrieval
# timestamp, source URL and reason are recorded, in the round-2 audit trail.
# See ROUND2_RENDERER_RUNBOOK.md section 4.1.
*QUARANTINE_NONCANONICAL*/
